              "printed_page": 16,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Epidermal cytology—bacterial infection.",
              "pdf_page": 98,
              "printed_page": 16,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Bacterial culture and sensitivity—tissue",
              "pdf_page": 98,
              "printed_page": 16,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Combine/withdraw administration of these cultures may differ from surface culture. medications carefully.",
