              "printed_page": 16,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "INTERACTIONS"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Antihistamines—may cause sedation.",
              "pdf_page": 98,
              "printed_page": 16,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "INTERACTIONS"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Psychotropic medications should be",
