    "TREATMENT": {
      "present": true,
      "status": "content",
      "content_blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "in animals on TCAs. Routine monitoring",
          "pdf_page": 98,
          "printed_page": 16,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Rule in/out bacterial, fungal, ectoparasitic, recommended. endocrine causes and treat accordingly along with pruritus control.",
          "pdf_page": 98,
          "printed_page": 16,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "If infection resolves and pruritus and/or lesions persist, consider biopsy, allergy workup, neurologic/orthopedic exam,",
          "pdf_page": 98,
          "printed_page": 16,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Monitor level of licking and chewing closely. radiographs, behavioral modification.",
          "pdf_page": 98,
          "printed_page": 16,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Treat underlying disease to prevent",
          "pdf_page": 98,
          "printed_page": 16,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Physical restraints—to permit healing. recurrence.",
          "pdf_page": 98,
          "printed_page": 16,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Limited research to support effectiveness:",
          "pdf_page": 98,
          "printed_page": 16,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "If no underlying disease detected, psychoradiation, acupuncture, CO2laser, cryosurgery, genic causes possible (compulsive or selfstandard surgery. mutilation disorder); prognosis is guarded.",
          "pdf_page": 98,
          "printed_page": 16,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Difficult to treat, especially if no underlying cause found; warn owner that patience and time are necessary.",
          "pdf_page": 98,
          "printed_page": 16,
          "column": 2
        }
      ],
